Zero point energy                ...      0.25258158 Eh     158.50 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01016072 Eh       6.38 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
